# horde-march.vrs: undead-hordes D25. The hm-test event (tools/vrclient/scenarios/fixtures/hm-test.json: a HordeMarch
# of 480 units, 380 troops at level 20, 79 elite at 40, 20 strong at 60 and the Bishop of Death at 50, from the pond's
# Point (-1880, -1640) to "the mark" 600 m east (-1280, -1640), radius 30, marchSpeed 2.0, growth 1-3 while the horde is under 500, infest
# hunters 60) runs twice.
# Run 1, unseen: Chaos waits 120 m north of the route. The front's percent climbs, and the horde arrives at the mark and
# logs the switch to the infestation.
# Run 2, met: Chaos stands on the route 300 m from the start. The game stops its own NPCs 80 m or more from every
# player, so a kill happens only near one (A8): once the horde's first CHAR_Undead_SkeletonSoldier_Armored_Farbane is
# within 100 m, the nearest one kills Chaos (`.devdie`, as in apocalypse.vrs) and the horde grows by 1-3 before it is
# met. Chaos respawns, returns, and the horde is met (A6: seen for 30 s in a row) and infests where it stands, with at
# least 40 of its 95 Armored_Farbane within 100 m of him.
# Each run ends with `.nyar event stop` and 0 tracked.
# After the session, on a copy of BepInEx/LogOutput.log:
#   pwsh tools/preflight.ps1 -TimingSpan <copy> -MinTracked 432          (90 % of the horde)
#   python tools/vrclient/load-ladder.py report <copy>    (steps 480 and 481: each frame window against D3's bars; the
#                                                          ladder's window counts do not apply to these short runs)
# Needs: `python tools/vrclient/fixture-install.py <server>/BepInEx/config/Nyarlathotep/events.json hm-test`; the dev cfg
# at the ladder's ceiling (MaxTrackedUnits 500, MaxUnitsPerWave 500, MaxSpawnsPerTick 20, MaxDespawnsPerTick 20,
# [Debug] TimingLog true; the limits are read at boot, so restart the server after the edit); NyarDevTools (.devtp .devframes .devnative .devnote
# .devunits) and DevChatEcho; pillar spawns on; no other event running; Chaos invulnerable (`ToggleInvulnerable true`,
# never false).
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .nyar pillar spawns on
expect-reply spawns
chat .nyar event reload
expect-log events: reloaded
expect-no-log event hm-test: timeout=3
chat .devframes on
expect-reply devframes: on
# run 1: Chaos 120 m north of the route
chat .devtp -1580 -1520
expect-log \[DEV TP\] to
wait 3
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 3
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
chat .devnote step=480 phase=start
expect-reply devnote: step=480 phase=start
mark
chat .nyar event start hm-test
expect-log event hm-test started by timeout=20
expect-log horde hm-test: 479 units, 1 bosses, from .* to the mark timeout=30
poll-reply RISE tracked units: 480 \(spawning 0, :: .nyar status every=5 timeout=300
chat .devnote step=480 phase=quiet s=${RISE} tracked=480
expect-reply devnote: step=480 phase=quiet
expect-log apocalypse hm-test horde 1 front (?P<P1>[0-9]+) % units timeout=60
expect-log apocalypse hm-test horde 1 front (?P<P2>[0-9]+) % units timeout=60
expect-calc ${P2} > ${P1}
expect-log horde hm-test: arrived at the mark after [0-9]+ s, (?P<ARRIVED>[0-9]+) units; infesting timeout=600
shot full hm-arrived
chat .devnote step=480 phase=drain
expect-reply devnote: step=480 phase=drain
chat .nyar event stop hm-test
expect-log event hm-test stopped timeout=20
poll-reply DRAIN tracked units: 0 \(spawning 0, despawning 0\) :: .nyar status every=3 timeout=600
chat .devnote step=480 phase=end s=${DRAIN} purged=${ARRIVED}
expect-reply devnote: step=480 phase=end
# run 2: Chaos on the route meets the horde
chat .devtp -1580 -1640
expect-log \[DEV TP\] to
wait 3
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
chat .devnote step=481 phase=start
expect-reply devnote: step=481 phase=start
mark
chat .nyar event start hm-test
expect-log event hm-test started by timeout=20
poll-reply RISE2 tracked units: 480 \(spawning 0, :: .nyar status every=5 timeout=300
chat .devnote step=481 phase=fight
expect-reply devnote: step=481 phase=fight
poll-reply FIRST devunits n=[1-9] :: .devunits -837329073 100 every=2 timeout=300
chat .devdie -837329073 100
expect-log \[DEV DIE\] found=1 timeout=10
expect-log apocalypse hm-test spread: \+(?P<GROW>[0-9]+) \( timeout=20
expect-calc ${GROW} >= 1 and ${GROW} <= 3
expect-no-log horde hm-test: met by a player timeout=1
# the respawn is a held space; a death resets invulnerability
hold space 1.5
wait 3
respawn-coffin 15
wait 10
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
chat .devtp -1580 -1640
expect-log \[DEV TP\] to
wait 3
console ToggleInvulnerable true
expect-log horde hm-test: met by a player after [0-9]+ s, (?P<MET>[0-9]+) units; infesting there timeout=600
expect-no-log horde hm-test: arrived at timeout=5
wait 20
chat .devunits -837329073 100
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\] n=(?P<NEAR>[0-9]+) prefab=-837329073
expect-calc ${NEAR} >= 40
shot full hm-met
chat .devnote step=481 phase=drain
expect-reply devnote: step=481 phase=drain
chat .nyar event stop hm-test
expect-log event hm-test stopped timeout=20
poll-reply DRAIN2 tracked units: 0 \(spawning 0, despawning 0\) :: .nyar status every=3 timeout=600
chat .devnote step=481 phase=end s=${DRAIN2} purged=${MET}
expect-reply devnote: step=481 phase=end
chat .devframes off
console TPHome
